    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1192-a5">

                <pb facs="0966" n="850" xml:id="pg850"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5—Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Alger to General Muñoz</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mazatlan</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 22, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Commander of <hi rendition="#italic">Annapolis</hi> advises me that up to now not
                    one single armed man has been landed on Mexican soil from the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Annapolis</hi>. He also assures me he has no knowledge
                    of any insult to Hernandez. American citizens on shore are carrying arms for
                    their protection, this on account of lack of protection from Mexican
                    authorities. I again request that you take measures to protect lives of
                    Americans at Topolobampo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alger.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
